description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok (musically/trill/lite) + Grab Passenger. 6-layer Java hook + 59 native prop + companion fork+setns bind mount overlay. v1.0.11: auto-summarizer on Action tap — raw session log (10+ MB) is condensed into a chat-friendly digest (~5-15 KB) + gzipped raw + persistent crash journal, all in /sdcard/Download/ternak-tt-logs/. Zero-cmd debug loop: flash debug zip → use app → tap Action → share summary-*.txt. Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS.
